    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"The eight files on this diskette contain the same data that are tabulated in parts B through I of U.S. Geological Survey Open-File Report 91-322.  The file names should be self-explanatory as to which quadrangle the data belong. USGS OFA 91-322-A contains the explanation of the analytical methods used in obtaining these data. The user is referred to parts A-I for all sample descriptions and locality information, including longitudes and latitudes.\"",
